a proud Monster who inhabits Tunium hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Berranes Ghoul","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a terrifying Ghoul who inhabits Berranes hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Methos Undead","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a giant Undead who inhabits Methos hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Aemoma Giant","legend":"Tipplers speak of a magical Giant who inhabits Aemoma hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Aberleitari Banshee","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a feared Banshee who inhabits Aberleitari hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Nimas-Tubaal Monster","legend":"Locals speak of a magical Monster who inhabits Nimas-Tubaal hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Sosaliarni Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Barairundo Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Victrera Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Roman Beliefs."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Connodure Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Roman Faith."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Gatza Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Gaumarra Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Estea Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Rasaiersb Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Germanic Religion."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Moviorum Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Roman Faith."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Cinatate Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Roman Faith."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Corviagutum Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Roman Faith."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Vesapure Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Ro