dc13\udc34\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Lamuvonia Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc35 \ud802𐠞\udc1d𐠓𐠏\ud802𐠐\udc11\udc24 \udc1a𐠳\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠬\udc33\udc12\udc27 𐠿 \udc0c\udc32𐠜\udc11\ud802𐠯\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc1b\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Zanaliarbil Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠔\udc01\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc03\ud802\ud802𐠔𐠖\udc1c\udc03\udc1b\udc2d\udc1e𐠵\udc3c 𐠡\udc0f\udc24 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠢\ud802𐠖\udc05\udc2e\udc35𐠑\udc32 \udc38\ud802𐠮\udc20𐠙\udc2b\udc32\udc26𐠬\udc18\udc2a\ud802 𐠵\udc0a𐠸\udc33𐠃\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc16\udc0d𐠠\udc27\udc16\udc1d𐠼𐠳\udc3f\udc0d\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠖\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Grengen Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠞\udc31\ud802𐠣𐠜\ud802𐠝\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc26\ud802𐠯\ud802 \udc38\udc31𐠍\udc0a\ud802𐠌\udc05\udc0d𐠗\udc15\udc1a\udc21\ud802𐠭𐠲𐠯\udc2f𐠂\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠗𐠅\udc2e</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Amphidna Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲶⳁⳲⳁⳖⳎⳂⳔⳐ ⲸⳎⳞⳆⳌⳒ⳩ⳐⳁⳐⳭⲶⳲⲼⳤⳆⳃⳁ Ⳡ⳥Ⳣ⳩ⳤⳂⳞⳔⳖⳜⲾⳃⳤⲲⳎⲼ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Dena Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳕ⳾ⳬⳀ  Ⲻ ⳔⳚⲺⳞⳞⳫⳄⳫⳭⳊⳘⳚ⳹Ⳙ ⳎⳞⳐⳫⳃⳫⳲⳚⳭⳞⳌⳃⳞⳎⳁⳌⲸⳌⳫⳲⲼ⳩Ⳟ Ⳏ⳾ⲾⳒⳬ ⳌⳲⲾ⳧Ⳑⳤ⳥ⳖⳚ⳩ⳐⳀⳀⳀⳁⳃ⳥ⳠⳠⲺⳂⳈⳬⳊⳞⲸⳈⳞⳬⳞⳁ ⲶⳤⳭⲺ</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Raniaiecto Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᠼᡒᠭᠧᡰᡱᠯᡔᠳᡖᠻᡒᠻᢢᢐᠱᡔᢒᢒᢋᠵᡑᠧᢀᡏᢢᢋᡝᠲᢡᠰᢁᡏᡮᡕᢑᡍᡐ᠑ᢦᢑᡳᠳᠲ᠐ᢓᢥᡟᢛᡲᢛᢐᢓᠮᠻᡡᠨᡯ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Orexa Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢏᢠᡎᠮᢜᢀᢠᡏᡏᡜᡏᢦᡐᢢᢠᠧᡲᠯᡯ᠀ᠾᡭᢑᠧᢁᠽᠡ᠐ᡓᢑᢐᠮᠻᡝᢛᡖᡡᢞᡞᢦᡓᡖᢡᠵᢤᠼᡙᠱᡰᢤᡳᢜᢋ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Sortius Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰከሀሐ ሐዘገደነየሰሐቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈሀወጠ ለደቀሠዐፐየበገ ጸጸሰቀጸዐጠፀጠፐዐረየደጠደተ በዘሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Gleigentia Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠሠጰገሰ ፀበጰ ተደአተጸረረደሰወ አአጸደገሰተደደ  ረገገቀ አፀበጸመቀበፀፀደአገፈለኀጠሠሠወቀመአቀኀሠነተወሰየአለሐገ ደጰተፀየጰገጰየነፐነሐጸ ፀፀወከ </div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Confluencan Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc20\udc14 𐠝𐠣\ud802𐠸\udc1a \udc25𐠱\ud802\ud802𐠚𐠈\udc22\udc18\udc29𐠩\udc05\ud802𐠨\udc2e\udc33\udc11\udc20\udc0c\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc02\ud802𐠟𐠑𐠡\ud802𐠜\ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802𐠒\ud802\ud802 \udc30\udc0d\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc18\udc20 \udc0f\ud802 \udc1a\ud802𐠗 \ud802\ud802𐠫\udc1b\udc2c</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Karraka Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༭༃་༔༨༖༳༉༣༛༖༫༉༗༦༤༺༳༥༱༗༁༚༒༵༻༜༇༫༱༉༣༻༨༉༓༨༕༢༡༄༗༒༒༜༌༓༽༦༯༙༂༢༰༌༩༄༯༼༶༯༣༇༐༕༵</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Dubrinimita Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᢀ᠀ᡎᢛᢛᠯ᠐ᢂᢋᡮ᠑᠐ᡰᠵᢑᡠᢦᡍᡖᠳᠯᠪᠧᠵᠨᢓᡔᠲᠿᠦᡓᢁᡲᠱ᠀ᢋᡁᢠ᠐ᢛ᠐ᡕᡴᢋᡭᡐᡞᠻᢀᢤᡏᡁ᠑ᡗᠽᠽᡙᢓᠾᢟᡖᡑᠯ</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","na